        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86191, 24 Inch Square Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Square Door Pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, concealed surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. Back to back mounting comes with  packaged with two pulls. This stainless steel door pull is available in modern finishes colors. The 24 Inch Square Door Pull has 12 inch mounting center. The pull has a 1-1/8 inch grip.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86191-Specifications.gif?v=1704354689\" width=\"600\" height=\"169\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 86191 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in Other Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-36-inch-square-door-pull-emtek-86192\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-48-inch-square-door-pull-emtek-86187\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>, or\r\n<a href=\"/products/72-inch-stainless-steel-square-door-pull-emtek-86188\"><b>72\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 86191 Contemporary Square 24 Inch Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\" </li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\" (with rosette)</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door. Packaged with  Decorative Screw Cover Caps.</li>\r\n<li><b>Concealed Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Comes as a set of 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Long-Pulls-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354641\" width=\"585\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Long Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
